TransAmiga v1.1 Documentation:
------------------------------

This archive should contain the files:

    Docs/Register.Doc       (Registration information excerpt from TransAmiga's
                             manual)
    Docs/License.Doc        (License information excerpt from TransAmiga's
                             manual)
    Docs/TransAmiga.Doc     (the TransAmiga BBS v1.1 manual)
    Doc.Read_Me             (this file)

Be sure that everything is in its proper sub-directory.

These files contain ANSI code formatting for printout.  To do this, simply
enter:

  type >PRT: Docs/TransAmiga.Doc

These files are only part of the complete TransAmiga v1.1 distribution. 
To get the rest of the necessary files, you must also obtain TA11_b.LHA
and TA11_c.LHA.


-Tim

